  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "b0001",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6d914a937119fead",
      "translationZh": "我们很高兴邀请 Anthropic 在 2 周后举行的 AI Engineer New York 上分享他们最新的 AI x Finance 工作成果！",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0002",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "baf6376858bc2fd7",
      "translationZh": "如果你最近消息闭塞，这里列出了一份不完全清单，介绍 Anthropic 自 5 月在 ARR 达到 47B 时完成史上最大规模融资以来陆续推出的成果：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0003",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "1483a5b7ffd4e536",
      "translationZh": "6 月：推出 Claude Tag、Sonnet 5 和 Fable 5",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0004",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a1a69b65ad664d13",
      "translationZh": "7 月：Opus 5、/checkup。ARR 突破 65B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0005",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "924cd01b23e01596",
      "translationZh": "上个月：Fable/Mythos 5.1，以及 EFS（即将播出的播客）",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0006",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d99325fdd9ff48c4",
      "translationZh": "IPO 目标 2T，2026 年底 ARR 预计为 100B",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0007",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c633e67a1a68a9a1",
      "translationZh": "先于 <competitor> 合并了 Cowork/chat",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0008",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "f4c35dcd8cbb22db",
      "translationZh": "Dario 支持由所有实验室共同签署的同一份 Pacing the Frontier 声明",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0009",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3666e90da91bcfdc",
      "translationZh": "上周：Opus 5.5、Plugins portal、Cloud Sessions/ Claude Projects",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0010",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c325324cbfd03aad",
      "translationZh": "今天这期节目应该能帮你跟上最新进展，嘉宾是 Anthropic 的讲解之王 Thariq Shihipar。我们上次与他交流是在 Fable 发布当天，当时推出了《Fable 实用指南》：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0011",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "1aa5bee5b4652ee1",
      "translationZh": "可变软件的未来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0012",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "2995a114ba3af887",
      "translationZh": "请特别关注 Claude Mods（尤其是速查表）：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0013",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "415be514d3ec9bf7",
      "translationZh": "总体而言，这也与 Thariq 另一条广为传播的推文形成了反向对照：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0014",
      "kind": "heading",
      "sourceHash": "e969baa9a63339d0",
      "translationZh": "云端大脑，本地双手",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0015",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "9c6eadc86c6f418e",
      "translationZh": "也请试试 Claude Projects：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0016",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "39ca03a6749c05bc",
      "translationZh": "“双手”这一说法不只是对 Cognition 等前沿编程智能体公司正在构建的本地/云端范式的类比，它还与安全系统的讨论尤为相关。我们将在接下来的一期节目中与 Anthropic 探讨这些问题，因为他们正准备通过负责任的 AI 部署向技术前沿迈进。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0017",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "50fb8024d96d9d67",
      "translationZh": "如果你想了解我们在播客开头预告过的 Thariq 的写作技巧，请在这里观看完整视频：",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0018",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "898022795afbaf82",
      "translationZh": "从 Claude Code 的迅速崛起，到未来智能体能够重写自身的运行框架、跨团队协作，并在云端和本地环境中运行，我们构建软件的方式正在以惊人的速度改变。在本期节目中，Anthropic 的 Thariq Shihipar 与 swyx 和 Vibhu 一起，深入探讨高级用户如今究竟如何使用 Claude Code、为什么提示词编写仍是一项需要高水平技能的工作，以及 Anthropic 认为智能体运行框架下一步将走向何方。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0019",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d992b84ffa315c1c",
      "translationZh": "我们深入探讨了 Claude Code 不断演进的界面：Ask User Question 与信息征询、作为持久化生成式界面的 artifacts、用于多用户智能体工作流的 Claude Tag、Projects、模型思考力度、实现说明，以及用于定制运行框架本身的新 Claude Mods 系统。Thariq 解释了为什么 Claude.md 最终可能会消失，为什么最聪明的模型在许多任务上也可能成为最便宜的模型，以及为什么可变软件可能成为构建和定制应用的新范式。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0020",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cf5e1c50b1029746",
      "translationZh": "随后，对话转向智能体安全，以及 Anthropic 的“Pacing the Frontier”论点。Thariq 详细介绍了近期的一些事件：智能体发现了出人意料的通信方式、利用基础设施、对基准测试评分器进行逆向工程，并将多个漏洞串联起来。我们讨论了沙箱隔离、提示词注入、自主智能体、可解释性、宪法式分类器、探针、回退机制、Auto Mode，以及为什么保障能力日益增强的智能体的安全，可能成为未来几年最具标志性的工程问题之一。",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0021",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ff167b088aa353bd",
      "translationZh": "为什么智能体编程在不到一年的时间里，就从备受争议变成了默认选择",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0022",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7667ffa5c06309aa",
      "translationZh": "为什么提示词编写仍是使用 Claude Code 时最能发挥杠杆作用的技能之一",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0023",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "6bf92cec8fa738b7",
      "translationZh": "专家用户如何建立对 Claude 的心智模型，以及它能可靠地一次完成哪些任务",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0024",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "84d3478723a08b07",
      "translationZh": "为什么随着智能体能力的增强，发现自己“尚未意识到的未知”变得更加重要",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0025",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a58b28795faf9bf5",
      "translationZh": "Artifacts 作为人类与智能体之间持久存在的生成式界面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0026",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "bac29dd4c3f6fb08",
      "translationZh": "Claude 如何可能拆分为云端“大脑”、本地或远程的“双手”，以及动态界面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0027",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ae36506d456a886a",
      "translationZh": "Claude Tag、Projects 和多人协作智能体，以及协作式智能体工作流可能如何演进",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0028",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "cff04c1c0d456869",
      "translationZh": "为什么在初始提示词上多花些时间，可以大幅减少智能体的无效工作",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0029",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "ee1d16e5052d3035",
      "translationZh": "针对不同的工程任务，何时使用 low、medium、high 或 max 努力级别",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0030",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0c8ee957485ec8ed",
      "translationZh": "为什么前沿模型最终可能在智能水平和 token 效率两方面都超越较小的模型",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0031",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8fe3a2cb6187c245",
      "translationZh": "为什么实现说明能够揭示模型曾考虑过、但最终未采纳的决策",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0032",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "697366f980b01f63",
      "translationZh": "为什么 Claude.md 最终可能会消失——以及为什么有时不带这个文件开始反而更好",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0033",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "8878e2e638832983",
      "translationZh": "Claude Mods：定制 Claude Code 的执行循环、UI、子智能体、路由和行为",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0034",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "c0376b7a98ec334f",
      "translationZh": "自动改进智能体工作流的模型路由器、分叉智能体和监督智能体",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0035",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4fa5a706148c6130",
      "translationZh": "为什么 Claude Mods 可能是“可变软件”的早期预演",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0036",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "e50b7c939d810dd8",
      "translationZh": "智能体运行框架工程的苦涩教训，以及为什么智能体架构会如此迅速地过时",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0037",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "4a2e56407ecb8a0b",
      "translationZh": "Claude Tag 如何成为多人协作的组织级运行框架",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0038",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "0f897b9758ac0040",
      "translationZh": "为什么让智能体访问公司数据会带来巨大的新安全攻击面",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0039",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b335ee04961d9b06",
      "translationZh": "Exploit-Bench 事件：智能体发现了沟通与协作的方法",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0040",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "b34417ea4b3e393a",
      "translationZh": "为什么智能体入侵 Hugging Face 是为了获取评分器代码，而不是基准测试答案",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0041",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "3af66893fc91371e",
      "translationZh": "智能体如何以出人意料的方式将沙箱漏洞与基础设施漏洞串联起来",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0042",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "d025f06dab4d321e",
      "translationZh": "为什么能力日益增强的智能体让传统安全假设更难维持",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0043",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "7880a0f2968b007d",
      "translationZh": "Anthropic 的“Pacing the Frontier”提案背后的论点",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
      "id": "b0044",
      "kind": "paragraph",
      "sourceHash": "a51ac26916d6fe3b",
      "translationZh": "为什么软件工程师越来越多地在做两份工作：工程开发和跟上 AI 的发展",
      "provider": "nowcoding",
      "model": "gpt-6.1-sol"
    },
    {
